@startuml brukerhistorie4Sekvensdiagram
hide footbox

title Brukerhistorie 4 - Lage konto og logge inn

actor "Student" as User
box "JavaFX-klient" #F1EFE8
participant "RegisterUserController /\nLoginController (ui)" as FormC
participant "BackgroundTaskRunner\n(ui)" as Runner
participant "RemoteAuthenticationClient\n(ui)" as AuthClient
participant "Navigation\n(ui)" as Nav
participant "UserSession\n(ui)" as Session
participant "RemoteReviewRepository\n(ui)" as Remote
end box
box "REST-server" #FAECE7
participant "UserController\n(rest)" as UserC
participant "UserService\n(core)" as UserS
participant "User\n(core)" as UserModel
participant "UserHandler\n(file)" as Handler
participant "TokenService\n(rest)" as Tokens
database "users.json" as File
end box

== Registrere ny bruker ==

User -> FormC : trykker «Registrer ny bruker» og fyller inn navn, e-post to ganger og\npassord to ganger, trykker «Lag ny bruker»
FormC -> FormC : checkForm(...)

alt feltene er tomme eller ikke like
    FormC --> User : viser feilmelding,\nsender ingenting
else skjemaet er gyldig
    FormC -> Runner : execute(register, onSuccess, onFailure)
    activate Runner
    Runner -> AuthClient : register(name, email, password)
    AuthClient -> UserC : POST /api/users\n{name, email, password}
    UserC -> UserS : register(name, email, password)
    UserS -> UserModel : new User(name, email, password)
    note right of UserModel : Validerer navn, e-post og passord.\nPasswordHasher lager salt og hash,\nså passordet lagres aldri i klartekst.
    UserS -> Handler : findByEmail(email)
    Handler --> UserS : Optional<User>

    alt e-posten er allerede registrert
        UserS --> UserC : kaster DuplicateEmailException
        UserC --> AuthClient : 409 Conflict + feilmelding
        AuthClient --> Runner : kaster IllegalArgumentException
        Runner --> FormC : onFailure, på JavaFX-tråden
        FormC --> User : viser «E-postadressen er\nallerede registrert.»
    else ny e-post
        UserS -> Handler : save(user)
        Handler -> File : addUserIfEmailAvailable(user)\nsjekker e-posten på nytt og lagrer\nunder samme skrivelås
        note right of Handler : Registrerer to brukere samme e-post\nsamtidig, kaster save også\nDuplicateEmailException (409).
        Handler --> UserS
        UserS --> UserC : User
        UserC -> Tokens : createToken(email)
        Tokens --> UserC : token
        UserC --> AuthClient : 201 Created +\n{token, name, email}
        AuthClient --> Runner : AuthenticationResult
        Runner --> FormC : onSuccess, på JavaFX-tråden
        FormC -> Nav : registrationSuccessHandler.accept(result),\nsom er Navigation.signIn
        Nav -> Session : signIn(token, name, email)
        Session -> Remote : setToken(token)
        note right of Remote : Tokenet sendes nå med alle\nkall som krever innlogging.
        FormC -> Nav : showHome(registerButton)
        Nav --> User : hjemmesiden som innlogget
    end
    deactivate Runner
end

== Logge inn senere ==

User -> FormC : skriver e-post og passord,\ntrykker «Logg inn»
FormC -> Runner : execute(login, onSuccess, onFailure)
activate Runner
Runner -> AuthClient : login(email, password)
AuthClient -> UserC : POST /api/login {email, password}
UserC -> UserS : login(email, password)
UserS -> Handler : findByEmail(email)
Handler --> UserS : Optional<User>
UserS -> UserModel : verifyPassword(password)

alt feil e-post eller passord
    UserS --> UserC : Optional.empty()
    UserC --> AuthClient : 401 Unauthorized\n(InvalidCredentialsException)
    AuthClient --> FormC : IllegalArgumentException\n(via onFailure)
    FormC --> User : viser feilmelding
else riktig
    UserS --> UserC : Optional med User
    UserC -> Tokens : createToken(email)
    UserC --> AuthClient : 200 OK + {token, name, email}
    AuthClient --> FormC : AuthenticationResult\n(via onSuccess)
    FormC -> Nav : loginSuccessHandler.accept(result),\nsom er Navigation.signIn
    Nav -> Session : signIn(token, name, email)
    Session -> Remote : setToken(token)
    FormC -> Nav : showHome(loginButton)
    Nav --> User : hjemmesiden som innlogget
end
deactivate Runner

@enduml